hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15827","Abd al-Rahman narrated to us, from Sufyan, from Abdullah, meaning Ibn Abi Bakr, and Salim Abu al-Nadr, from Sulayman ibn Yasar, from Abdullah ibn Hudhafah, that the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, commanded him to announce during the days of Tashriq that they are days of eating and drinking."
